{
  "commit": "e68baa2 (branch ai/gh-1831, tip bc1be69)",
  "rca": "The web sandbox FS loader probed window._fahFsGetAllDefined, a global web/fs_store.js never defined, so every save/remove on every web host threw 'fs_store.js is not loaded' and nothing persisted; independently the web catalog install fetched only manifest.json/widget.js/icon, so multi-file widgets like fa-craft (a stub entry importing ./game/main.js) installed incomplete and evaluated to an empty script that never rendered.",
  "description": "Fixed on branch ai/gh-1831 (commits up to e68baa2, tip bc1be69 merging origin/main): fs_persistence_web.dart now probes the __fahFsGetAll/Set/Remove functions fs_store.js actually ships via window.hasProperty; catalog_service.dart's web install resolves and fetches the full transitive relative-import/jsr.include source closure from the pinned preview ref (missing file fails the install loudly, escape paths rejected); js_app_engine.dart's never-rendered watchdog names the missing source files instead of blaming a syntax error.",
  "verification_test": "flutter_app/test/apps/catalog_web_source_closure_test.dart::a web-installed multi-file widget boots through the real assembler; flutter_app/test/apps/js_app_engine_boot_error_test.dart; flutter_app/test/fs_store_script_gate_guard_test.dart"
}
